Unreleased
---
Cleanup
- Remove the Qt version branches below 5.15, which K1 set as the minimum: the
  hand-written qByteArrayToHex/toHexLower helpers that existed for Qt below 5.9, the
  QPixmap::devicePixelRatio fallback, the QString::SkipEmptyParts fallback, the
  QFlags::setFlag fallback and the QFontMetrics::width fallbacks in DockLabel

Bugfix
- DockPanel: do not reopen an auto hide panel while a widget is inserted into
  it, which unpinned the widget again and left an empty panel in the root
  splitter

Test
- cover DockGroup, DockGroupManager and DockSubWindow with tst_DockGroup
  (structural API, group-name validation, and perspective save/load round-trip)

